# Lint, format, typecheck. The three checks AGENTS.md asks every commit to pass.
#
# `lint-staged` runs ESLint and Prettier over the staged files only and restages
# what it fixes, so this stays quick as the codebase grows. The typecheck is
# whole project on purpose: a change in one file breaks types in another, and
# `tsc` has no meaningful staged files mode.
#
# Genuinely need to get past this? `git commit --no-verify`. CI runs the same
# checks plus the tests, so it will be waiting for you there.
pnpm lint-staged
pnpm typecheck
